ATTRIBUTION

`Background.qml` in this plugin is a derivative of the `omarchy.background`
plugin from Omarchy (https://omarchy.org), Copyright (c) Omarchy contributors,
also licensed under the MIT License. The original file provides the wallpaper
renderer, its transition machinery and its click handling; this plugin adds the
photo transform, the colour grade and the weather layer above it.

Omarchy's full licence text is distributed with Omarchy itself.
